      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Vaikunthanathar\nThayaar: Vaikuntavalli Nachiyar\nVimanam: Chandra Vimanam\nPushkarani: Brighu Theertham\n\nTravel: This kshethram is situated on the banks of the Tamaraparani, approximately 35 km from Tirunelveli.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nNam Azhwar: 2 Pasurams",
